{"claim-id": "syn-009", "ts": "2026-05-21T11:30:00Z", "requestor": "desmond", "request": "redesign the scoring system \u2014 dual scores for achievements and errors", "action-taken": "replaced single reputation score with dual Score A (achievements) and Score E (errors) system. Zero on E is perfect. No cancelling between scores. Added 'I Forgot' rule, infraction table, and score card reading examples. Updated RFP-001 spec and this ledger.", "outcome": "success", "risk": "medium", "human-readable": "Desmond caught that the old scoring system had fake penalties that couldn't be enforced. We redesigned it together: two independent scores \u2014 Achievements for successful work, Errors for mistakes and accountability failures. Zero on errors is the goal. They don't cancel each other out. A human reads both and judges.", "mistakes": [{"what": "original spec used penalty/bonus system that implied automated enforcement", "caught": "Desmond asked 'how can we penalty?' \u2014 real question, no good answer", "fix": "scrapped old system entirely. Dual score card: Achievements and Errors, separate, no cancelling. Score E starts at zero and only goes up on infractions."}], "corrections": [], "feedback": "", "verification": "self"}
